          "description": "User verified in the GPU showcase 2026-07-17 (\"Perfect\"): click focuses without a ring, keyboard navigation rings, Checkbox rings the box only. Implementation: Base::shows_focus_ring() gating all 13 ring sites (focus-visible semantics), [appearance] show_focus_border override wired through chrome_gui_theme with config.default.toml docs, Checkbox ring → box_rect(), regression test focus_ring_shows_on_keyboard_focus_not_on_mouse_click, docs/widgets.md \"The focus model\" section. Committed together with the T011 glow work (single commit per user request)."
